---
const capabilities = ["Agent loop", "Tool execution", "Event log", "Studio + API"];
---
<div class="fh-runtime">
  <div class="fh-column-label"><span>02 / PLICO HANDLES</span><span>The harness.</span></div>
  <div class="fh-harness">
    <div class="fh-harness-top"><span class="fh-plico-mark" aria-hidden="true">p</span><span>plico</span><span class="fh-harness-note">around your agent</span></div>
    <div class="fh-capabilities">{capabilities.map((capability, index) => <div data-capability={index}><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6l2.5 2.5L10 3" /></svg>{capability}</div>)}</div>
    <div class="fh-agent">
      <div class="fh-agent-heading"><div class="fh-avatar" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div><div><b>Support agent</b><span>from support-agent/</span></div><span class="fh-agent-state" data-agent-state>ready to take shape</span></div>
      <div class="fh-conversation">
        <div class="fh-placeholder"><span></span><span></span><span></span><p>Your files become its behaviour.</p></div>
        <div class="fh-request"><span>YOU</span><p>The team can’t connect to the VPN. Can you open a ticket?</p></div>
        <div class="fh-tool"><span class="fh-tool-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↳</span><div><span>create_ticket</span><code>"Team VPN connection issue"</code></div><span class="fh-tool-check">✓</span></div>
        <div class="fh-answer"><span>AGENT</span><p data-answer>Created ticket TCK-104 for the VPN issue, with the details your team needs.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="fh-event"><span class="fh-event-light"></span><code data-event>Waiting for your files</code><span data-event-count>—</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="fh-harness-bottom"><span>You define the behaviour.</span><span>Plico runs the project.</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="fh-run-footnote"><span>ILLUSTRATIVE RUN</span><span>In development</span></div>
</div>
